WEBVTT

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.860
Mou Bu's Declaration

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.990
"Kan"

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.450
Careful!

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:14.740
I know!

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.120
Do it.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.130
Smoke?

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.550
Don't breathe it in!

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.850
It's gone!

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:38.430
Nothing happened!

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:40.520
What was that all about?

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:42.270
Did it not work?

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:44.230
Sir, are you hurt?

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:45.110
No.

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:47.570
Let's evacuate, just in case.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.700
"Gi"

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:55.370
We're going back. All troops,
fall back to the main camp's position.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:56.990
Sir!

00:00:56.990 --> 00:01:00.870
After all, the real show is still to come.

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:03.210
What the--what what what <i>what</i>?!

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:08.010
The Kan army's leaving!
But why? Why is that?

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:11.430
O Gi Ko doesn't... he doesn't understand!

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:14.390
Hey, what's going on?!

00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:16.260
Hmm? Boss?

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:55.980
Sano, Land of Sho

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:53.240
Come on in!

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:55.400
You won't find it cheaper!

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.070
Best food around!

00:02:56.690 --> 00:03:00.030
Kyou Kai

00:02:58.120 --> 00:02:59.950
So I've come this far.

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.450
Almost there.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.250
Welcome, welcome!

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.710
Maybe I should eat a real meal for once.

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:14.670
Here's your rice porridge with chicken!

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.300
Hey, hurry up with the grub!

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:16.680
Let's go.

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:17.800
Delish!

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:20.890
Time sure flies, you know?

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:25.850
The coalition army's been fighting
at Kankoku Pass for 14 days now.

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:27.060
Wow!

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.810
Fourteen days...

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:32.610
They sure have.
But as I hear it, that's all over.

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:36.360
Kankoku Pass fell in the
most glorious fashion!

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.660
Then they took Kanyou--

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:42.530
with an all-out slaughter that
would put Battle of Chouhei to shame!

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:44.370
Serves 'em right!

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:51.670
Oh, please. That's just a rumor--
made up out of whole cloth!

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:52.500
Huh?

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:53.880
It is?

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.960
You got us all excited for nothing!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:56.970
Ow!

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:58.720
Yeowch!

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:01.640
Who threw that bowl of porridge?!

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:06.310
I wonder how the battle is <i>really </i>going.

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:12.650
My cousin in the army tells me
there's still a lot of ups and downs.

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.940
Really? Advancing, then retreating?

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:19.860
Yeah. There are rumors that the coalition
army's doing that on purpose...

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:23.910
But either way, the Chin army
is definitely fighting strong.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.750
I mean, they'd have to be, right?

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:33.540
After all, if they lose,
they lose a country.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:33.620
"Chin" "Sho"

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:36.130
Shin!

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.180
"Sho" "Chin" "Hi"

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:45.060
Stay with Shin!

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:47.550
"Chin" "Hi"

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:51.560
Kanyou

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:55.070
I don't follow.

00:04:55.070 --> 00:04:59.030
Why would the coalition army
want a drawn-out battle?

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:03.280
Yes, rations are a problem...
but more than anything,

